EXFOR DATABASE NOTE — 12C + 59Co
==================================

Entry: D6173
Reference: F.K. Amanuel et al., Eur. Phys. J. A 47, 156 (2011)
Access: https://www-nds.iaea.org/exfor

IMPORTANT LIMITATION:
D6173 contains ONLY α-emission channels (subentries .009–.012):
  D6173.009 → αn channel (66Ga)
  D6173.010 → α2n channel (65Ga)
  D6173.011 → αpn channel
  D6173.012 → αp2n channel

CF-DOMINATED CHANNELS ARE ABSENT:
  p3n → 67Ge  (NOT in EXFOR)
  2p2n → 67Ga (NOT in EXFOR)

These CF channels were measured in:
  A. Agarwal, I.A. Rizvi, A.K. Chaubey, Phys. Rev. C 65, 034604 (2002)
  but have not been compiled into EXFOR for this system.

RECOMMENDATION:
Compilation of Agarwal et al. [2002] CF-dominated channels into EXFOR D6173
is recommended to enable direct CF validation from the database.

CITATION ERROR NOTE:
Amanuel et al. [2011] cites the Agarwal paper as "034605" — this is incorrect.
The correct page number is 034604.
PRC vol. 65, 034605 is an unrelated paper (Raduta et al., fission dynamics).
